:: Felix Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> are walking along chatting when you suddenly hear a strange beeping sound coming from his wrist. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> looks down at his watch and sighs, saying something in French before looking back up to you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, but I have to be going. It’s getting late and my host family has a strict curfew. It would be wrong for me to disobey.”</span> He shrugs. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Felix",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Ask him to stay out a little longer<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You ask if he can stay a little longer. Afterall, what’s the worst that can happen if he’s a little late? <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, the parents have permission to beat my butt if they want.”</span> He laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Though I doubt they would. Still, I do not want to be disappointing. So, for the best that I head back. But it was fun to hang out with you! We should do it again very soon!”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You smile at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> and bid him farewell. The boy is too well-behaved for his own good. One day you’ll have to make him earn that spanking.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>

	<<link "Give him a hug goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You sigh, a bit sad, but accept that the boy has to go. You stretch your arms out for a hug goodbye and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> quickly reciprocates. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Look on the bright side, I still have many weeks here, so we can hang out again very soon!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He says with a smile before you bid farewell to the boy. He is right, there is always tomorrow.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>